{"id":"29860e308d5c5265","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence.md","title":"组合公理与闭去引号实例的关系","display":"lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence — 组合公理与闭去引号实例的关系","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence","aliases":["91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence","91-lem-comp-equiv","91-lem-axiom-equivalence"],"display":"lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence — 组合公理与闭去引号实例的关系","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence</span><span>91-lem-comp-equiv</span><span>91-lem-axiom-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-compositional-axiom-equivalence — 组合公理与闭去引号实例的关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73ccb673e6681e3d\" href=\"?note=73ccb673e6681e3d\" title=\"91-thm-compositional-completeness\">91-thm-compositional-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (能处理编码并证明原子正确性的基础理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span>\n(基础语言上的组合公理, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> (经典一阶逻辑中的可推导关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\n\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\n\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反过来，对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，\n相应闭去引号实例在经典逻辑中给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi,\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\varphi\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{CL}}\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\n\\\\[1mm]\n&amp;\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi,\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\psi,\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{CL}}\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi,\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\varphi\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{CL}}\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\n\\\\[1mm]\n&amp;\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi,\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\psi,\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{CL}}\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取的闭实例同理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明是在元理论中对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 句子作结构归纳：原子情形由\n基础公理处理，否定、合取和量词步骤分别使用对应组合公理。</p>\n<p>反方向只能按上式逐个闭实例说明。TB 的逐句公理本身不自动\n给出对公式编码统一量化的组合模式，尤其不能无条件推出量词组合公理。\n所以文件名中的“equivalence”只指固定闭实例之间的经典等价，不是两个\n公理模式在弱基础理论中的无条件双向等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":""